      "detail": "The browser writes an offer in SDP: the media it wants to send (Opus audio; video in VP8, H.264 and others), the fingerprint of its DTLS certificate, its ICE user name and password, and its candidates, the addresses it might be reached at. Its private address is hidden behind a random .local name. The signalling server passes the offer on to Sam.",
